// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H3I.
//
// This read-only systems-look-development composition inherits the H3H shared-renderer
// temporal witness and authors native face/upper-body proportions, crown flow, and bounded
// analytic skin microdetail. The presentation bridge still invalidates temporal history
// during motion and tier changes because it has no motion vectors. This is not biometric
// likeness, production grooming, motion-reprojected TAA, or full-world convergence.

